; cluster for all optics quantities: light, reflection, refraction, diffraction, spectrum.
; optics is a subdomain of electromagnetism: light is an EM wave.
; also a subdomain of oscillation: light has frequency, wavelength, period.
; the speed of light is the universal limit — connects to seema.
; units: wavelength in metres; frequency in hertz; intensity in W/m²
; sangati roots

(kosha optics-varga
  (vishesa electromagnetism-varga oscillation-varga)
  (swarupa subanta taranga)
  (matra metre hertz second)
  (yukta spanda seema vega))
